name: Read actual scope rejection and retain spending without repeating work
size: 120x36
# Owned non-Git fixture. The helper authenticates all nine source files and receipts.
require-shell: test -d @TARGET
cwd: @TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR
env: HOME=/private/tmp/kuzushi-live-monorepo-scope-20261014/home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_scope_failure.py @TARGET @ART inspect
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: campaign live-scope-proposal-20261014
require-live-snap: 25 1 failed | failed-proposal
expect: work ended
expect-not: L resume
nav-mode:
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 new approved plan | consumed-attempt-refusal
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 Inspect scope proposal outcome | scope-outcome
require-live-snap: 25 unknown shared dependency greeting | recorded-validation-cause
expect: No automatic repair or rerun
ask: Does the scope outcome lead with the actual validation cause and make inspection and separately approved replacement work clear?
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 15 proposal rejected | cause-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 15 proposal rejected | cause-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 15 proposal rejected | cause-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 15 proposal rejected | cause-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 15 proposal rejected | cause-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: failure-page-40x12
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
require-live-snap: 15 attempts remain recorded. | spending-last-40x12
ask: Can the operator read the recorded failure, spending and no-rerun terms at every required size using visible paging controls?
resize: 120x36
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 25 DRAFT SCOPES | original-inventory-draft
expect: Whole repository
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_scope_failure.py @TARGET @ART refused
submit: logs
submit: run campaign:allowance {"investigationId":"live-monorepo-scope-20261014"}
require-live-snap: 25 Calls committed: 1/3 | shared-spending
expect: Unresolved calls: 0
expect: dollar ceiling: not enforced
ask: Does reading the failed real request retain one consumed attempt and one request, disclose unknown dollars, and leave scope acceptance and scanning separate?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=/private/tmp/kuzushi-live-monorepo-scope-20261014/home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: campaign live-scope-proposal-20261014
require-live-snap: 25 1 failed | retained-failure
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 unknown shared dependency greeting | retained-cause
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_scope_failure.py @TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart preserve the real cause, unchanged source and receipts, original scope draft and all spending without a new request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
